# Nx Boundaries

Source of truth: `docs/architecture/boundaries.md`.

## Tag Axes

Every project: `scope:*` + `layer:*` (apps also `type:app`).

| Project | Tags |
|---------|------|
| `shared-kernel-types`, `contracts`, `utils`, `config` | `scope:shared`, matching `layer:*` |
| `domain` | `scope:backend`, `layer:domain` |
| `application` | `scope:backend`, `layer:application` |
| `platform` | `scope:backend`, `layer:platform` |
| `postgres` (path `packages/infrastructure/postgres`; later `redis`, `messaging`) | `scope:backend`, `layer:infrastructure` |
| `logger` (path `packages/infrastructure/logger`) | `scope:backend`, `layer:infrastructure`, `layer:logger` |
| `nest-http` | `scope:backend`, `layer:nest-http` |
| `composition` | `scope:backend`, `layer:composition` |
| `frontend-ui` | `scope:frontend`, `layer:ui` |
| `frontend-core` | `scope:frontend`, `layer:frontend-core` |
| `api`, `worker` | `scope:backend`, `type:app` |
| `web`, `admin` | `scope:frontend`, `type:app` |

## Hard Constraints (intent)

```
scope:shared   → scope:shared only
scope:backend  → backend + shared
scope:frontend → frontend + shared

layer:domain         → shared-types only
layer:platform       → shared-types only
layer:contracts      → shared-types only
layer:application    → domain, platform, shared-types, utils
layer:infrastructure → domain, application, platform, shared…
layer:nest-http      → contracts, platform, shared (not domain/application/postgres)
layer:composition    → domain, application, infrastructure, platform…
type:app             → nest-http / composition / logger / frontend libs / shared (never other apps, never postgres/domain/application)
```

## Forbidden Edges

```typescript
// ❌ domain → contracts / application / infrastructure
import { InviteMemberInput } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/contracts'

// ❌ application → infrastructure
import { TypeOrmTenantRepository } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/postgres'

// ❌ frontend → backend
import { Tenant } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/domain'

// ❌ shared → frontend/backend framework code
```

## Context Isolation

Contexts are folders, not projects. Enforce with folder-level lint: `domain/src/tenancy` must not import `domain/src/authorization` internals. Cross-context: IDs + events only.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm nx graph
pnpm nx affected -t lint,test,build
```
